  "worked_solution": "First, we compute the triple scalar product \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =\u27e82,3,-1\u27e9\\cdot \u27e84,-1,6\u27e9 \\\\  & =2\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =8-3-6 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (c\\times a)=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
